    "text": "1 days ago SIOUX FALLS, S.D. (KELO) – Sioux Falls voters will head to the polls Tuesday to decide who they want to represent them in the four city council seats. These candidates will help shape the future of South Dakota's largest city. Candidates are competing in the Southeast and Central district races, as well as two citywide at-large seats. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
